      "id": "CO-ING-8-2026-W15-review-p3-001-MASTERY-v10",
      "statement": "Identify the error:\r\n\"Maria **said (A)** that she **had (B)** a great time yesterday. If she **had (C)** more free time, she **will (D)** visit us again.\"",
      "context": "Identifying errors in a multi-tense paragraph.",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "said",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect."
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "had",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect. Correct shift from \"I had\" or \"I am having\"."
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "more",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect. Correct adjective in the condition."
        },
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "text": "will",
          "is_correct": true,
          "feedback": "Correct! Error found. The result of a second conditional must be \"would\", not \"will\"."
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "D",
      "explanation": "La mezcla de estructuras es un reto en B1. El estudiante debe detectar que \"had\" (pasado simple) en la condición requiere \"would\" en el resultado.\r\n\r\n---",
